          <ol><li><a href="#t-01"><span>01</span>Using This Website</a></li><li><a href="#t-02"><span>02</span>The Work You See Here</a></li><li><a href="#t-03"><span>03</span>Ownership of Creative Work</a></li><li><a href="#t-04"><span>04</span>When You Contact Me</a></li><li><a href="#t-05"><span>05</span>What a Project Includes</a></li><li><a href="#t-06"><span>06</span>What a Website Can and Cannot Guarantee</a></li><li><a href="#t-07"><span>07</span>Tools and Services Outside My Control</a></li><li><a href="#t-08"><span>08</span>Information and Website Tracking</a></li><li><a href="#t-09"><span>09</span>External Websites</a></li><li><a href="#t-10"><span>10</span>Responsibility and Limitations</a></li><li><a href="#t-11"><span>11</span>Changes to This Page</a></li><li><a href="#t-12"><span>12</span>Applicable Law</a></li><li><a href="#t-13"><span>13</span>Get in Touch</a></li></ol>
